{% assign lts_schedule = include.lts_schedule | default: site.data.learn_to_scull_schedule %}
{% assign cohort = include.cohort %}
{% assign program_number = cohort.name | default: page.lts_program_number | default: "[LTS#]" %}
{% assign session_dates = cohort.session_dates | default: page.session_dates %}
{% assign program_start_date = session_dates[0] | split: "(" | first | strip | default: page.program_start_date | default: "[Start date]" %}
{% assign session_time = lts_schedule.session_time_display | default: page.session_time | default: "8:30 - 11:30 am" %}
{% assign session_start_time = lts_schedule.session_start_time | default: page.session_start_time | default: "8:30 AM" %}
{% assign arrival_time = lts_schedule.arrival_time | default: page.arrival_time | default: "8:20 AM" %}
{% assign meeting_location = lts_schedule.meeting_location_arrival | default: page.meeting_location | default: "the main entrance of Beal Community Boathouse at Bandemer Park" %}
{% assign instructors = cohort.coaches | default: page.instructors %}
{% assign public_site_url = site.url | append: site.baseurl %}
Dear {{ program_number }} Participants,<br><br>

We're looking forward to welcoming you to our Learn to Scull program ({{ program_number }}) starting on {{ program_start_date }} at {{ session_start_time }}. Please arrive by {{ arrival_time }} at {{ meeting_location }}.<br><br>

**Final Checklist**<br><br>
- USRowing Learn-to-Row membership ({{ lts_schedule.usrowing_learn_to_row_fee }}) - required for insurance<br>
- AARC waiver completed online<br>
- Weather: {{ lts_schedule.weather_summary | default: page.weather_summary | default: "Check the latest forecast and dress for the conditions; the program runs rain or shine unless unsafe." }}<br><br>

**What to Bring**<br><br>
- Snug athletic clothes (no baggy items that catch in tracks). Dress in layers appropriate for the forecast.<br>
- Water bottle (32 oz recommended)<br>
- Sunscreen, hat & sunglasses<br>
- **Towel & full change of clothes** - you'll get wet during flip test, and cool + windy conditions make this essential<br><br>

**Quick Reminders**<br><br>
- Program runs {{ session_time }} on {{ lts_schedule.session_days }} for both weekends.<br>
- Review materials: [Session 1 prep]({{ public_site_url }}/for-learners/learning-journey/session-1.html)<br>
- No pressure, no competition - relax and enjoy learning!<br><br>

**Important Notes**<br><br>
- Summer session = busy boathouse. Please be mindful when moving equipment<br>
{% if cohort.logistics_note or page.special_logistics_note %}
- {{ cohort.logistics_note | default: page.special_logistics_note }}<br>
{% endif %}<br><br>

See you on the water!<br><br>

Best regards,<br><br>
{% include communication_templates/signature.liquid instructors=instructors lts_schedule=lts_schedule %}
